  "description": "Browse, search, and manage a BibiGPT saved library: already-summarized videos, personal notes, and collections. Use when the user asks what they already saved, to search past summaries, edit a note, or organize videos into a collection. Do not use to summarize a new URL (that is the `bibi` skill), follow channels / pull a subscription feed (`bibi-feed`), or analyze frames / generate a mind map (`bibi-vision`). Triggers: \"what have I summarized\", \"search my library\", \"my saved videos\", \"my notes\", \"create a collection\", \"add to collection\", \"我之前总结过的\", \"资料库\", \"搜我的笔记\", \"合集\", \"列出最近的总结\", \"整理合集\", \"move folder to root\", \"把文件夹移到根目录\", \"my highlights\", \"划线\", \"高光\". Same `bibi` CLI binary and same BibiGPT account as the other skills.",
